  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kyiv. Study Shipbuilding University, Mykolaiv</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Study of the Shipbuilding University in Mykolaiv: The National Shipbuilding University was damaged by war and on-site activities reduced. Study includes assessment of current level of research and education with a view to strategies for building back a better and greener institution. Sustainability, partnerships and long-term cooperation will be assessed and recommendations prepared.</narrative>
